{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":35,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"f39aca80-ea2a-46a2-9c9c-d676e5a481ff","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190675039,"PostDateInt":1790598672280,"PostDate":"2026-09-28T20:31:12.2804228","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"BSP工程师(J10351)","OrgId":567593,"Org":"内镜业务部（中央研发）","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责嵌入式Linux的软件架构及方案设计；\n2.负责uboot、kernel系统裁剪、移植、编译、优化；\n3.负责BSP驱动开发及移植；\n4.与FPGA、软件、硬件等相关专业方向一起进行软硬件开发联调，负责分析解决Linux及驱动相关的问题；\n5.参与新产品技术预研、产品研发及在线产品的维护，协助解决售后反馈的故障；","Require":"1.全日制本科及以上学历，计算机、电子、通信等相关专业，三年以上工作经验；\n2.熟悉主流ARM平台的芯片资源和系统架构，有嵌入式Linux系统移植、裁剪、优化经验，有显示接口、外设接口、高速数据通讯接口的驱动开发经验，了解FPGA设计流程和Verilog设计语言，具备与FPGA工程师联合开发的经验和能力；\n3.了解Makefile、Shell、git、repo等脚本编译工具以及gerrit、jenkins等配置管理工具，有良好的编码风格，擅于总结归纳，乐于技术分享；\n4.具备较好的问题分析和解决能力，能与相关专业方向积极配合，完成开发调试任务；\n5.具有较好的团队合作精神和沟通协调能力，具有较强的责任感和自驱力，具有独立工作的能力；\n6.具有内窥镜、安防监控、工业相机等产品Linux BSP开发经验优先考虑；","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":"深圳南山","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"1","ChangeDate":"2026-09-28T20:31:12.2804228","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJo